<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>New Newsletter Subscriber</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f6fb; color: #1f2937; padding: 24px 12px; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(15, 28, 128, 0.06); }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0F1C80 0%, #15237F 100%); color: #ffffff; padding: 28px 32px; border-bottom: 4px solid #F39300; }
        .badge { display: inline-block; background: rgba(243, 147, 0, 0.2); color: #F39300; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(243, 147, 0, 0.3); }
        .header h1 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px; color: #ffffff; }
        .header p { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); line-height: 1.4; }
        .content { padding: 28px 32px; }
        .greeting { font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #374151; }
        .body-text { font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.65; }
        .cta { text-align: center; margin: 28px 0 16px 0; }
        .cta a { display: inline-block; background: #0F1C80; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 28px; border-radius: 24px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(15, 28, 128, 0.2); }
        .footer { background: #f9fafb; padding: 18px 32px; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #f0f2f5; }
        .footer a { color: #0F1C80; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <span class="badge">Newsletter Subscription</span>
            <h1>New Newsletter Subscriber</h1>
            <p>Someone has just subscribed to the Mashar newsletter.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p class="greeting">Hi <strong>Admin</strong>,</p>
            <p class="body-text">
                <a href="mailto:<%= email %>" style="color: #0F1C80; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;"><%= email %></a> subscribed to the Mashar newsletter on <strong><%= subscribedAt %></strong>. A confirmation email has been sent to them automatically.
            </p>

            <div class="cta">
                <a href="<%= actionLink %>" style="color: #ffffff;">View Subscribers in Admin &rarr;</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Mashar Leadership &amp; Coaching Platform &bull; <a href="https://mashar.org">mashar.org</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
